{"id": 103, "name": "klutz", "is_main_series": true, "generation": {"name": "generation-iv", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/generation/4/"}, "names": [{"name": "\u3076\u304d\u3088\u3046", "language": {"name": "ja-hrkt", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"}}, {"name": "\uc11c\ud22c\ub984", "language": {"name": "ko", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/3/"}}, {"name": "\u7b28\u62d9", "language": {"name": "zh-hant", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/4/"}}, {"name": "Maladresse", "language": {"name": "fr", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"}}, {"name": "Tollpatsch", "language": {"name": "de", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/6/"}}, {"name": "Zoquete", "language": {"name": "es", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"}}, {"name": "Impaccio", "language": {"name": "it", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/8/"}}, {"name": "Klutz", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}}, {"name": "\u3076\u304d\u3088\u3046", "language": {"name": "ja", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"}}, {"name": "\u7b28\u62d9", "language": {"name": "zh-hans", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/12/"}}, {"name": "Torpeza", "language": {"name": "es-419", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/14/"}}], "effect_entries": [{"effect": "Au combat, ce Pok\u00e9mon ne peut pas utiliser son objet tenu, et n\u2019aura aucun effet passif sur le combat, positif ou n\u00e9gatif.  Ce Pok\u00e9mon ne peut pas non plus utiliser D\u00e9gommage.\n\nLa baisse de Vitesse de la Balle Fer et les objets d\u2019effort (le Bracelet Macho, Poids Pouvoir, Poignet Pouvoir, Ceinture Pouvoir, Lentille Pouvoir, Bandeau Pouvoir, et Cha\u00eene Pouvoir) ne sont pas affect\u00e9s.  Les objets qui n\u2019affectent pas directement le combat, tels que le Multi Exp, la Pi\u00e8ce Rune, ou le Grelot Zen, fonctionnent normalement.  Tous les objets tenus fonctionnent normalement hors combat.\n\nLes autres capacit\u00e9s qui utilisent l\u2019objet tenu, telles que Don Naturel et Passe-Passe, fonctionnent normalement.", "short_effect": "Emp\u00eache le Pok\u00e9mon d'utiliser son objet tenu au combat.", "language": {"name": "fr", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"}}, {"effect": "Pok\u00e9mon mit dieser F\u00e4higkeit k\u00f6nnen im Kampf keine getragenen Items benutzen und diese haben auch keine passiven Effekte im Kampf, egal ob positiv oder negativ. Das Pok\u00e9mon kann Schleuder nicht einsetzen.\n\nDer Initiative Malus einer Eisenkugel und die EV Items (Machoband, Machtgewicht, Machtreif, Machtgurt, Machtlinse, Machtband und Machtkette) sind nicht betroffen. Items die den Kampf nicht direkt beeinflussen, wie der EP-Teiler, das M\u00fcnzamulett oder die Sanftglocke, funktionieren normal. Alle getragenen Items funktionieren normal au\u00dferhalb von K\u00e4mpfen.\n\nAndere Attacken die getragene Items verwenden, wie z.B. Beerenkr\u00e4fte und Wechseldich, funktionieren ebenfalls normal.", "short_effect": "Verhindert, dass das Pok\u00e9mon ein getragenes Item im Kampf einsetzt.", "language": {"name": "de", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/6/"}}, {"effect": "In battle, this Pok\u00e9mon cannot use its held item, nor will the item have any passive effect on the battle, positive or negative.  This Pok\u00e9mon also cannot use Fling.\n\nThe Speed cut from the Iron Ball and the effort items (the Macho Brace, Power Weight, Power Bracer, Power Belt, Power Lens, Power Band, and Power Anklet) is unaffected.  Items that do not directly affect the battle, such as the Exp. Share, the Amulet Coin, or the Soothe Bell, work as usual.  All held items work as usual out of battle.\n\nOther moves that use the held item, such as Natural Gift and Switcheroo, work as usual.", "short_effect": "Prevents the Pok\u00e9mon from using its held item in battle.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}}], "effect_changes": [{"version_group": {"name": "black-white", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/11/"}, "effect_entries": [{"effect": "D\u00e9gommage peut \u00eatre utilis\u00e9 de mani\u00e8re habituelle.", "language": {"name": "fr", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"}}, {"effect": "Schleuder kann normal benutzt werden.", "language": {"name": "de", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/6/"}}, {"effect": "In battle, this Pok\u00e9mon cannot use its held item, nor will the item have any passive effect on the battle, positive or negative. The Speed cut from the Iron Ball and the effort items (the Macho Brace, Power Weight, Power Bracer, Power Belt, Power Lens, Power Band, and Power Anklet) is unaffected. Items that do not directly affect the battle, such as the Exp. Share, the Amulet Coin, or the Soothe Bell, work as usual. All held items work as usual out of battle. Other moves that use the held item, such as Natural Gift and Switcheroo, work as usual.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}}]}], "flavor_text_entries": [{"flavor_text": "The Pok\u00e9mon can\u2019t use\nany held items.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version_group": {"name": "diamond-pearl", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/8/"}}, {"flavor_text": "The Pok\u00e9mon can\u2019t use\nany held items.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version_group": {"name": "platinum", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/9/"}}, {"flavor_text": "The Pok\u00e9mon can\u2019t use\nany held items.", "language": {"name": "en", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"}, "version_group": {"name": "heartgold-soulsilver", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/10/"}}, {"flavor_text": "Le Pok\u00e9mon ne peut\nutiliser aucun objet tenu.", "language": {"name": "fr", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"}, "version_group": {"name": "black-white", "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/ve